OL,3,GNEWSAStaffordshire roads flooded as
OL,4,AStorm Austen hits
OL,5,
OL,6,FAreas of north Staffordshire are
OL,7,Fflooded, as Storm Austen hits the
OL,8,Fregion, having battered southern parts
OL,9,Fof the UK earlier on Friday.
OL,11,FA slip road on the A500 for
OL,12,FSandyford/Tunstall saw a car stranded
OL,13,Fas motorists try to navigate difficult
OL,14,Fconditions.
OL,16,FMeanwhile, the Greyhound Gap dog rescue
OL,17,Fcharity in Kidsgrove said they had to
OL,18,Fevacuate their dogs to an emergency
OL,19,Fshelter because their premises had
OL,20,Fflooded.
